Tests for the crumBS page in uQ Settings (uq/pages/crumbs/).

  logic.test.mjs     Node: logic.js, page.toml, packaging of the page (node --test 'tests/uq/*.test.mjs')
  tst_page.qml       QML: the page against a fake ctx (needs Qt 6; runs in CI)
  stub/ FakeContext.qml tst_components.qml
                     the page test kit of uQ v0.3.0-rc.1 (templates/settings-page-tests/), unchanged.
                     Refresh them when moving to a newer uQ.
  fixtures/          crumbs --json answers; see fixtures/README

Run the QML tests offscreen:

  QML_XHR_ALLOW_FILE_READ=1 QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen qmltestrunner -import tests/uq/stub -input tests/uq

(/usr/lib/qt6/bin/qmltestrunner on Arch.) QML_XHR_ALLOW_FILE_READ lets tst_page.qml read the fixtures.
